{"applies_when":["twin.conditions.active has any of ['胃溃疡','消化性溃疡','反流','胃食管反流','GERD']"],"blocks":["self_manage_reflux_alarm_features","self_escalate_acid_suppression"],"body":"出现黑便、呕血、进行性吞咽困难、无法解释的体重下降、持续呕吐、贫血线索或胸痛时，系统不得把问题降级为普通反流自我管理；应提示就医或联系医生并整理症状时间线。","confidence":0.86,"decay_rate":"slow","doc_id":"contraindication:reflux_gastric_alarm_features_escalation","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"GERD","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"提示及时就医或联系医生；只整理症状、用药和时间线，不给治疗方案。","forbidden_when":["black_stool","vomiting_blood","progressive_dysphagia","unexplained_weight_loss","persistent_vomiting","anemia_signal","chest_pain"],"input":{"query":"反流合并黑便还可以先自己观察吗"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-26T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"gastroenterology","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_gastro_rhinitis_pr2","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-26T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr2","safety_tags":["alarm_feature","medical_escalation"]},"sources":["guideline:acg-gerd-2022"],"summary":"反流或胃病伴报警特征时禁止自我管理降级，必须升级为就医提醒。","title":"反流和胃病报警特征升级边界"}
{"applies_when":["twin.conditions.rhinitis.active == true","twin.conditions.active has any of ['反流','胃食管反流','咽喉反流','LPR','GERD']"],"blocks":["self_change_acid_suppression","self_change_rhinitis_medication"],"body":"鼻炎样症状与反流重叠时，系统只能提出待验证假设和记录计划；不得要求用户自行加用、停用或替换抑酸药、鼻喷药或抗组胺药。","confidence":0.78,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:rhinitis_reflux_overlap_no_self_escalation","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"LPR","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"C","fallback":"建议记录鼻炎、咽喉、餐后和平卧相关症状，并带给耳鼻喉科或消化科医生复评。","forbidden_when":["self_directed_medication_escalation","self_directed_medication_stop","single_cause_attribution"],"input":{"query":"鼻炎可能是反流导致的，我能自己加药吗"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-26T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"gastro_rhinitis","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_gastro_rhinitis_pr2","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-26T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr2","safety_tags":["hypothesis_only","no_medication_adjustment"]},"sources":["guideline:acg-gerd-2022","review:lpr-upper-airway"],"summary":"鼻炎与反流重叠只能作为待验证假设，禁止自行调整抑酸或鼻炎用药。","title":"鼻炎反流重叠不允许自行加减药"}
{"applies_when":["twin.wearable.spo2_min_overnight < 88","twin.wearable.spo2_odi >= 5","twin.wearable.spo2_below_90_pct >= 1"],"blocks":["train_harder_for_low_spo2","ignore_nocturnal_hypoxia","self_start_sleep_device_or_sedative"],"body":"夜间低氧、ODI 升高或低于 90% 的时间比例增加时，系统不得把问题降级为“多运动就好”或推动高强度训练；也不得建议用户自行启用睡眠呼吸器械、镇静药或其它治疗。","confidence":0.86,"decay_rate":"slow","doc_id":"contraindication:sleep_spo2_do_not_push_harder","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"sleep-breathing-risk","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"提示复测夜间血氧并整理打鼾、晨起头痛、白天嗜睡、饮酒和镇静药线索；需要时就诊呼吸或睡眠中心评估。","forbidden_when":["exercise_escalation_as_fix","ignore_sleep_breathing_risk","self_directed_pap_or_sedative"],"input":{"query":"昨晚血氧掉了，今天是不是应该练狠一点"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"sleep_safety","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_sleep_spo2_pr4","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr4","safety_tags":["sleep_breathing","no_training_escalation","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["guideline:aasm-osa-diagnostic-testing-2017","guideline:aasm-pap-osa-2019"],"summary":"夜间低氧或 ODI 升高时禁止把加大训练作为解决方案，应转为睡眠呼吸评估和复测。","title":"夜间低氧不允许用加大训练替代评估"}
{"applies_when":["twin.acute.should_rest_from_training == true","twin.acute.fever_reported == true","twin.acute.suspected_cold == true","twin.acute.has_active_illness == true"],"blocks":["train_through_fever","escalate_workout_during_acute_illness","self_medicate_to_enable_training"],"body":"急性发热、疑似感染或感冒样状态下，系统不得鼓励用户带病加量、用发汗/硬练解决不适，或建议用户自行服药后完成训练目标。若出现胸痛、呼吸困难、晕厥、持续高热或症状加重，应转为就医/急症评估提醒和资料整理。","confidence":0.84,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:acute_illness_no_training_escalation","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"acute-illness-exercise-boundary","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"将运动目标改为休息/恢复；提示记录体温、症状变化、用药和红旗症状，必要时联系医生。","forbidden_when":["fever_training_escalation","sweat_it_out_advice","self_medication_for_training","ignore_red_flags"],"input":{"query":"发热感冒了，今天能不能练狠一点出出汗"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"movement_safety","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_exercise_acute_pr5","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr5","safety_tags":["acute_illness","no_training_escalation","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["clinical_reference:mayo-exercise-illness-2023","clinical_reference:aha-exercise-when-sick-2021"],"summary":"急性发热/疑似感染时禁止把带病加量或发汗硬练作为建议，应降级为恢复和红旗症状观察。","title":"急性病状态禁止训练升级"}
{"applies_when":["twin.genetics.TPMT_phenotype in ['intermediate_metabolizer', 'poor_metabolizer']","twin.genetics.NUDT15_phenotype in ['intermediate_metabolizer', 'poor_metabolizer']","twin.medications intersects ['azathioprine', 'mercaptopurine', 'thioguanine']"],"blocks":["self_adjust_thiopurine_dose","self_stop_thiopurine","self_start_thiopurine_from_dtc_pgx"],"body":"TPMT 或 NUDT15 intermediate/poor metabolizer 与硫嘌呤用药上下文同时存在时，系统不得把消费级/DTC 基因结果直接转成剂量、停药、换药或启动用药建议。应提示由处方医生结合临床 PGx 结果、适应证、血常规和替代方案决策。","confidence":0.9,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:tpmt_nudt15_no_self_adjust_thiopurines","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"thiopurines","entity_type":"drug","evidence_level":"A","fallback":"提示用户整理基因报告、当前药名/剂量、血常规和不适症状，联系处方医生或药师复核；不要自行改动硫嘌呤。","forbidden_when":["consumer_pgx_direct_dosing","self_directed_dose_change","self_directed_stop_or_start","ignore_cbc_monitoring"],"input":{"query":"TPMT 慢代谢，硫唑嘌呤是不是自己减量或停掉"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"medication_safety","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_pgx_thiopurine_pr6","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr6","safety_tags":["pgx","thiopurine","no_self_dosing","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["cpic:thiopurines-tpmt-nudt15-2025","pubmed:41618934"],"summary":"TPMT/NUDT15 风险表型合并硫嘌呤用药时，禁止由系统或用户自行生成剂量/停药决策。","title":"TPMT/NUDT15 硫嘌呤禁止自行调药"}
{"applies_when":["twin.labs.systolic_bp >= 130","twin.behavioral.diet_sodium_mg_today >= 2300"],"blocks":["self_adjust_antihypertensive","extreme_sodium_restriction","single_meal_bp_attribution"],"body":"血压偏高合并高钠饮食线索时，系统不得把饮食记录直接转成降压药启停、加减量或极端限盐方案；也不得把单餐高钠归因成确定病因。应提示用户继续记录家庭血压、饮食来源和症状，并在需要时带记录咨询医生或营养师。","confidence":0.84,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:high_sodium_bp_no_med_adjustment_or_extreme_restriction","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"salt-reduction","entity_type":"intervention","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"提示用户记录 3-7 天家庭血压、外卖/包装食品/酱料来源和饮食变化；若血压持续偏高或已有降压药问题，应联系医生。","forbidden_when":["medication_adjustment_from_diet_log","zero_salt_directive","single_meal_causal_claim","diagnosis_from_bp_and_sodium"],"input":{"query":"今天吃咸了血压高，是不是自己调整降压药或完全不吃盐"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"cardiovascular_nutrition","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_diet_sodium_bp_pr7","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr7","safety_tags":["sodium","blood_pressure","no_med_adjustment","no_extreme_restriction","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["guideline:dietary-guidelines-americans-sodium","guideline:acc-aha-hypertension-2017","pubmed:29133356"],"summary":"高钠饮食与血压偏高只能触发饮食来源识别和监测闭环，禁止药物调整或极端限盐。","title":"高钠血压场景禁止调药或极端限盐"}
{"applies_when":["twin.conditions.rhinitis.active == true"],"blocks":["decongestant_overuse","self_escalate_rhinitis_medication","ignore_rhinitis_red_flags"],"body":"鼻炎、鼻塞或疑似过敏性鼻炎场景下，系统不得把症状反复直接转成鼻喷激素、抗组胺或口服/鼻用减充血剂的用户自主管理升级；不得鼓励长期依赖羟甲唑啉、伪麻黄碱等减充血剂来压住鼻塞，也不得忽略反跳性鼻塞、单侧症状、鼻出血、面痛、嗅觉变化或哮喘加重。","confidence":0.84,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:rhinitis_decongestant_overuse_no_self_escalation","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"allergic-rhinitis","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"提示记录鼻塞/喷嚏/流涕、诱因、鼻腔冲洗、现有鼻喷或口服药使用情况，并联系耳鼻喉科或过敏科医生复评；不生成启停、替换或升级用药方案。","forbidden_when":["rebound_congestion_signal","self_directed_medication_escalation","long_term_decongestant_reliance","single_sided_or_bleeding_red_flags","asthma_worsening"],"input":{"query":"鼻炎鼻塞反复，我能不能多用减充血剂或自己换鼻喷药"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"rhinitis","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_rhinitis_treatment_pr8","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr8","safety_tags":["rhinitis","decongestant","rebound_congestion","no_medication_adjustment","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["guideline:aaaai-rhinitis-practice-parameter-2020","clinical_reference:medlineplus-oxymetazoline"],"summary":"鼻炎场景禁止把鼻塞转成自行升级鼻喷/口服药或长期依赖减充血剂；反跳鼻塞和红旗症状应复评。","title":"鼻炎减充血剂过度使用和自行升级禁区"}
{"applies_when":["twin.conditions.active has any of ['胃溃疡','消化性溃疡','peptic ulcer']","twin.conditions.hp_status == 'positive'"],"blocks":["self_directed_h_pylori_eradication","antibiotic_regimen_generation","skip_post_treatment_confirmation"],"body":"HP 阳性与消化性溃疡同时存在时，系统不得把检测结果转成用户自主管理的根除治疗、抗菌组合、剂量或疗程；也不得省略治疗后复查确认。应提示联系消化科医生，整理检测方式、既往用药、药物过敏、妊娠/肝肾功能线索和复查问题。","confidence":0.86,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:hp_positive_no_self_eradication_regimen","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"helicobacter-pylori-positive","entity_type":"condition","evidence_level":"B","fallback":"提示用户联系消化科医生核对医嘱，并整理检测结果、用药史、过敏史、症状时间线和复查计划；不生成根除方案。","forbidden_when":["self_directed_eradication_regimen","antibiotic_selection","dose_or_duration_generation","omit_confirmation_testing"],"input":{"query":"幽门螺杆菌阳性胃溃疡，能不能自己安排根除治疗"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"gastroenterology","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_hp_positive_pr9","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr9","safety_tags":["h_pylori","no_antibiotic_regimen","follow_up_testing","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["guideline:acg-hp-2024"],"summary":"HP 阳性消化性溃疡禁止由系统或用户自行生成根除治疗方案；必须保留医生医嘱和复查确认。","title":"HP 阳性根除治疗禁止自行生成方案"}
{"applies_when":["twin.genetics.CYP2C19_phenotype in ['poor', 'intermediate']","twin.medications has any of ['clopidogrel','omeprazole','esomeprazole','lansoprazole']"],"blocks":["self_switch_antiplatelet","self_switch_ppi","consumer_pgx_direct_medication_change"],"body":"CYP2C19 intermediate/poor metabolizer 与氯吡格雷或 PPI 用药上下文同时存在时，系统不得把 CPIC 或消费级基因结果直接转成自行换抗血小板药、停药、换 PPI 或调整剂量。应提示用户整理基因报告、当前药名、处方医生、适应证、出血/血栓风险线索和胃病复查计划，由医生或药师复核。","confidence":0.88,"decay_rate":"normal","doc_id":"contraindication:cyp2c19_no_self_switch_antiplatelet_or_ppi","doc_type":"contraindication","entity_id":"CYP2C19","entity_type":"gene","evidence_level":"A","fallback":"提示整理 CYP2C19 报告、当前药名/剂量标签、支架或胃病适应证、出血/血栓风险和医生问题清单；不要自行替换或停用抗血小板药/PPI。","forbidden_when":["consumer_pgx_direct_switch","self_directed_antiplatelet_change","self_directed_ppi_change","dose_generation_from_pgx"],"input":{"query":"CYP2C19 慢代谢，氯吡格雷或奥美拉唑是不是自己换药"},"last_confirmed":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","metadata":{"claim_boundary":"Health management guidance only; not diagnosis, prescription, or treatment.","domain":"medication_safety","license_scope":"internal_transformed_claims","origin":"owner_curated_cyp2c19_pr10","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00","reviewed_by":"owner-reviewed-pr10","safety_tags":["pgx","cyp2c19","clopidogrel","ppi","no_self_switch","medical_boundary"]},"sources":["cpic:guideline-cyp2c19-clopidogrel","cpic:guideline-cyp2c19-ppi","pubmed:35034351","pubmed:32770672"],"summary":"CYP2C19 风险表型合并氯吡格雷或 PPI 用药时禁止把 PGx 结果转成自行换药、停药或剂量决策。","title":"CYP2C19 氯吡格雷/PPI 禁止自行换药"}
